[{"client_msg_id":"56cc2979-0ee8-414a-aede-873dc6c7c460","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"あ、あれ。。？(記憶違いだったようだ)\n```(let ((elm '(a b))\n      target)\n  (setq target (cons elm elm))\n  (print target)\n  (setcar target 'fix)\n  (print target))\n;;=\u0026gt; \n;;   ((a b) a b)\n;;   \n;;   (fix a b)\n\n(let ((elm '(a b))\n      target)\n  (setq target `(,elm . ,elm))\n  (print target)\n  (setcar target 'fix)\n  (print target))\n;;=\u0026gt; \n;;   ((a b) a b)\n;;   \n;;   (fix a b)```","ts":"1618153784.135800","edited":{"user":"UDPT2BZ6E","ts":"1618153793.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W2k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2440c496-cf08-4c65-935f-816724aa5002","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Schemeだし若干スレチ感あるけどこんなので使っていたな \u003chttps://gist.github.com/kuuote/f6506dd020550f1c7f50c48bdf1ef911#file-trilambda-scm-L127\u003e","ts":"1618153619.135500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2dF13"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e33805b9-7994-4198-b842-2e7c24868b85","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"cons、新しいメモリを確保するんですよね。バッククオートはnconc相当なので、できるだけ同じメモリを使おうとするのが違います。","ts":"1618153506.134900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"subara","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dkj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58281663-b568-4b1d-9e50-19e7b4e36048","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"SXML組み立てるのにテンプレート代わりに使ってたりとかしてましたね、これをconsやlistでやるのはつらい","ts":"1618153465.134700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EDncB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bc51b1ba-155d-42ae-9541-30fb5fc2b991","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"それならconsでやってしまいそう","ts":"1618153358.134200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aI9P"}]},{"client_msg_id":"391a1c71-aff9-4ef3-81fd-de65b4fb3a99","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"覚えてなかっただけで自分が書いたコード見返したらしれっとあちらこちらで使ってましたね…","ts":"1618153353.134000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sx2U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d48be19d-0867-45bc-be29-cdeb44bb3073","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"例えばmapcarで使ってますね。多分この用途だとconsを選択する人が多いと思う。\n\u003chttps://github.com/conao3/leaf.el/blob/ab5cc26b56a6a53a3338ebfde17b746522c2c14c/leaf.el#L648\u003e\n```(mapcar (lambda (elm) `(,elm . ,(leaf-alist-get elm leaf-alias-keyword-alist))) alias-from)```","ts":"1618153289.133300","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: conao3/leaf.el","id":1,"title":"conao3/leaf.el","title_link":"https://github.com/conao3/leaf.el/blob/ab5cc26b56a6a53a3338ebfde17b746522c2c14c/leaf.el#L648","text":"Flexible, declarative, and modern init.el package configuration - conao3/leaf.el","thumb_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4703128?s=400\u0026v=4","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","thumb_width":400,"thumb_height":400,"from_url":"https://github.com/conao3/leaf.el/blob/ab5cc26b56a6a53a3338ebfde17b746522c2c14c/leaf.el#L648","original_url":"https://github.com/conao3/leaf.el/blob/ab5cc26b56a6a53a3338ebfde17b746522c2c14c/leaf.el#L648"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7AR+R"}]}]
